--- BASELINE REPAIRS (pre-existing integration breakage that blocked the solution-wide gate) ---
The inherited integration HEAD (fc5ba227f, clean tree) carried two pre-existing defects that broke the
whole-solution build/test gate before any AIUsageCard code existed. Both were repaired minimally; neither
touches AIUsageCard logic. The second masked the first: the csproj XML-load failure short-circuited the
build before compilation, hiding the namespace collision until the csproj was repaired.
1. DrivetrainHealth triple-definition (CS0101): feature-views/HealthRecommendations/HealthRecommendations.Model.cs
   declared `public enum DrivetrainHealth` TWICE (its own merge-debris duplicates) on top of the single
   canonical definition in feature-views/HealthOverview/HealthOverview.Model.cs - three declarations of the
   same type in namespace TeslaSync.App.FeatureViews. Both files are globbed into TeslaSync.App and linked
   into TeslaSync.App.Tests, so the collision failed the C# Pass1 compile in both projects -> no local
   reference assembly -> the XAML markup compiler cascaded (WMC0001 / WMC0110 / WMC9999, 85 errors).
   Fix: removed BOTH duplicate enum blocks from HealthRecommendations.Model.cs; its references resolve to the
   one canonical HealthOverview.Model.cs definition (whose doc comment already documents the shared ownership).
   Minimal and intent-preserving - no behaviour change, no other file touched.
2. Corrupt multi-root test csproj (MSB4025): apps/windows/TeslaSync.App.Tests/TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj had
   its header comment region re-concatenated by a chain of integration merges into orphaned prose containing
   literal Project / Compile XML tags -> invalid XML ("'Compile' start tag on line 52 does not match the end
   tag of 'Project'") -> dotnet build/test could not load the project at all. Per the file's own documented
   INVARIANT, consolidated back to ONE valid <Project> root holding the deduplicated, path-sorted union of all
   537 previously-linked Compile sources + this surface's 3 new links (AIUsageCard.Model/Source/ViewModel.cs)
   = 540 total. No linked source dropped; the header comment was rewritten with no literal build-item tags.

