--- PARITY (web/src/features/settings/components/AIUsageCard.tsx) ---
- Composition: bordered section (web rounded-md / border-subtle / p-4) > Subhead "Usage today" > 3-column grid
  (Tokens in / Tokens out / Estimated cost) > Caption. Reproduced with native tokens (DisplayTokens.Border /
  Surface / Radius), Subhead + Caption typography primitives, no Tailwind ported.
- Data hooks actually used by source: useAiUsageToday (-> IAiUsageTodaySource cache-then-network over
  GET /ai/usage/today, generated op get_api_v1_ai_usage_today, no path/query params - user-scoped server-side),
  useTranslation (-> ILocalizer), useFormatting (-> currency symbol + ScalarFormatters).
- Values: token counts via grouped integers (web fmtInt -> ScalarFormatters.FormatNumber(x,0)); cost via the
  active currency symbol from cost_micro_cents / 1_000_000 at 2 decimals (web formatCurrency). Absent / error
  values render the long em-dash sentinel (web PLACEHOLDER '—'), exactly as the web degrades.
- Caption: call_count > 0 ? "{n} Helix calls today." : the empty/placeholder copy (web branch reproduced).
- i18n keys (all six from source are wired through the i18n facade with the web English fallback):
    translation.ai.settings.usage.title      = "Usage today"        (present in shared catalog)
    translation.ai.settings.usage.tokensIn   = "Tokens in"          (present in shared catalog)
    translation.ai.settings.usage.tokensOut  = "Tokens out"         (present in shared catalog)
    translation.ai.settings.usage.cost       = "Estimated cost"     (present in shared catalog)
